Peter was recruited by the Foundation while he was studying archaeology. He joined because the ideals of The Foundation match his own. His goal is to "to protect history not exploit it; to learn without limits, explore ancient secrets and preserve forgotten traditions." {{source|Into the River of Secrets}}

Peter saved two people on a boat from being drawn into a whirlpool on the [[Seine River]] created by the emerging power of [[Gar-Ghoul]] in [[Rouen, France]]. After being contacted via phone by [[Guggenheim]], Peter was apprehended by [[DeFoe]] for [[the Organization]] to gain information about Gar-Ghoul form him. [[Zhalia Moon]] freed Peter, and he accompanied [[Dante Vale]], [[Sophie Casterwill]], and [[Lok Lambert]] to the [[Cave of the Gargoyle]] in the [[Paris Catacombs]]. Because of his lack of Seeker abilities, Sophie was assigned to protect him by Dante for the duration of the mission. He later injured his ankle during an fight with a [[Suit]].{{Source|Into the River of Secrets}} When they entered the lower chamber of the cavern, he accidentally triggered a trap by using his flashlight. {{source|Crawling the Catacombs}}

On their mission [[The Mausoleum of Sir Lancelot]], the team met Peter at the [[Cathedral of Notre Dame]] for details on the [[Mausoleum of Sir Lancelot]]. Peter also warned them {{source|Memory Lane}}

Peter was seen at the surprise party at [[Dante Vale's house]] following the defeat of [[the Professor]]. {{source|The Mission}}

Some time later, Peter became an undercover janitor in [[Tower of Nostradamus|Nostradamus' tower]], which had been converted into the Tower of Nostradamus. When [[Wilder]] and his team arrived to obtain [[Nostradamus' Scrying Glass]], he and [[Billie]] attempted to attack [[the Organization|the Organization's]] [[Suits]] with a mop but was quickly knocked back by a [[Raypulse]] from [[Hoffman]]. He then tried to help Billie but the pair were knocked out and taken hostage. After waking, Peter made his way to a window and signaled to the Huntik team to watch out for the Suits at the entrance. The team then freed him and Peter took Billie and [[Annette]] to the Foundation hospital. {{source|The Tower of Nostradamus}}
